      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why boastest thou thyself in mischief, O mighty man?\nThe lovingkindness of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy tongue deviseth very wickedness,\nLike a sharp razor, working deceitfully.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou lovest evil more than good,\nAnd lying rather than to speak righteousness. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou lovest all devouring words,O thou deceitful tongue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God will likewise destroy thee for ever;\nHe will take thee up, and pluck thee out of thy tent,\nAnd root thee out of the land of the living. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous also shall see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and fear,\nAnd shall laugh at him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "saying",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, this is the man that made not God his strength,\nBut trusted in the abundance of his riches,\nAnd strengthened himself in his wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But as for me, I am like a green olive-tree in the house of God:\nI trust in the lovingkindness of God for ever and ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.52.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will give thee thanks for ever, because thou hast done it;\nAnd I will hope in thy name, for it is good, in the presence of thy saints.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Futility of boastful wickedness.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician. Maschil of David; when Doeg the Edomite came and told Saul, and said unto him, David is come to the house of Ahimelech.",
